  "body": "Side branch: side/path-kernel\n\nThis is a sync PR by the rule **Side branch** of `AGENTS.md`. It merges `main` into `side/path-kernel` with `git merge`. There is no rebase and no force-push.\n\n## Main merged\n\nTwo merges of `main`, because `main` moved during the work:\n\n1. `ec314174e3afe7d88524c6cecb4b4afe871dd65d`: merge commit `2a86ec090`.\n2. `a5e99353831828b877523c02dc4bd2145f80c377`: merge commit `ea0b5b733`. This merge brings the fix of #4322 (PR #4329) and the Side branch rule (PR #4326). It has no conflict and no hand edit.\n\nHead: `ea0b5b733370b02a3a20176b8a0dd778ff9737f2`.\n\n## Conflicts and resolution\n\nOne textual conflict, in the first merge:\n\n- `crates/app/src/operation/mod.rs`: keep both sides. The side branch adds `mod planner_switch;` and `pub use planner_switch::{PHASE1_KINDS, check_engine, planner_engine};`. Main adds `AgieSketch` to the `agie_profile` re-export. The result keeps the two module lines and the one re-export with `AgieSketch`.\n\nOther files that the two sides changed (`AGENTS.md`, `crates/app/src/lib.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/generate/run_job.rs`, `crates/app/tests/offset_pass_start.rs`, `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs`, `xtask/src/heavy_plan_tests.rs`, `xtask/src/tests.rs`) merged with no conflict. Each side only added lines there. No logic was changed on the two sides.\n\n## Compile fixes\n\nNone. `cargo check --tests` passed for each package one at a time (geometry, pathkernel, motion, sim, post, app, ui; then tools, post, app, ui after the second merge). The xtask crate lists (`BATCH_CRATES`, `ALL_CRATES`, `CLIPPY`) already hold `pathkernel` and `gpu`. Main added no crate.\n\n## Re-recorded baselines and readings\n\nMain changed the output of the old planners on purpose. Each pin below is re-recorded as measured on the merged tree, in commit `307323f10`.\n\nAttribution method: a probe puts only the five ring files of #4014 (`level_flanks.rs`, `level_order.rs`, `level_rings.rs`, `ring_fill.rs`, `ring_links.rs`, which no other main PR touched) back to the merge base. With that probe, each #4014 pin below is green again with its old value. The probe was not committed. #4008 is the only main PR that touched `adaptive_troch*`, and the new golden has its clean-up step-down notes.\n\n| File | Case | Old | New | Caused by |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `crates/motion/tests/kernel_laws/laws_pockets.rs` | 2D Offset, disc Outside | entry air 0, over 13 | entry air 1, over 11 | #4014 |\n| same | 2D Offset, dog bone Outside | over 41 | over 39 | #4014 |\n| same | 2D Adaptive (Offset ring fallback), disc Outside | entry air 0, over 13 | entry air 1, over 11 | #4014 |\n| same | 2D Adaptive, dog bone Outside | over 41 | over 39 | #4014 |\n| `crates/app/tests/offset_pass_start/kernel_laws_fig8.rs` | 2D Offset, fig8 Inside | lifts 3, col 3, over 413, worst 173 | lifts 4, col 4, over 125, worst 170 | #4014 |\n| same | 2D Offset, fig8 Outside | lifts 7, air 5, col 3, over 875 | lifts 2, air 2, col 1, over 85 | #4014 |\n| same | 2D Adaptive, fig8 Inside | over 148, worst 173 | over 36, worst 170 | #4014 |\n| same | 2D Adaptive, fig8 Outside | over 188 | over 27 | #4014 |\n| `crates/app/tests/golden/offset2d_fig8_{auto,inside,inside_arc,outside,outside_arc}.cl` | #3750 shared planner, #4055 switch default | old ring output | new ring output | #4014 |\n| `crates/app/tests/golden/kernel_pocket2d_fig8_{waterline_inside,waterline_outside,rings_outside}.cl` | #4153 fig8 Pocket baseline | old ring output | new ring output (Waterline Auto and Zigzag do not change) | #4014 |\n| `crates/motion/tests/golden/kernel_adaptive_trochoidal.cl` | #4153 trochoidal baseline | 821 moves, 38 clean-up passes | 2709 moves, 158 clean-up passes, the peel-step and the 113.5 deg engagement notes | #4008 |\n\nCount by cause: #4014 caused 16 pins (8 table rows, 8 goldens). #4008 caused 1 golden. No pin changed that I could not attribute.\n\nKernel-side pins do not change: the `laws` suite of `camcraft-pathkernel` (163 tests), the K3/K4/K6a tests of `kernel_laws`, and `kernel_rings` and `kernel_guides` are green with no edit.\n\n## Class\n\nDELTA. The hand edits are:\n\n- the conflict hunk in `crates/app/src/operation/mod.rs` (merge `2a86ec090`);\n- the re-recorded pins in commit `307323f10` (test files and goldens only).\n\nThe second merge (`ea0b5b733`) has an empty remerge-diff.\n\n## Gates (final head `ea0b5b733`)\n\n- `CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=6 xvfb-run -a cargo xtask gate batch`: 1234 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled, 70.2 min. This includes clippy and the `example_catalog*` suites.\n- `cargo xtask gate light`: 7 steps, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test -j 6 -p xtask`: green (363 unit tests and the integration suites).\n- The re-recorded heavy pins, in release with `--ignored`: `offset_pass_start` (`shared_planner`, `kernel_laws_fig8`, `planner_switch`: 9 passed) and `pocket_pass_start` (`kernel_baseline`: 2 passed).\n\nThe batch gate on the first merge (`307323f10`) had three red suites: `wcs_flip_dialects`, `wcs_index` and the ui lib test `setup_wcs_tests`. These were the known red of main at `ec314174e` (#4322). The second merge brings the fix, and the gate on the final head is green.\n\n## Note\n\nThe open sub-PR for #3752 (the 2D Pocket recipe, branch `issue/3752-kernel-pocket-recipe`) takes this sync after it merges.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nRefs #4023\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
